## https://github.com/meiji163/gh-notify#key-bindings-fzf
Toggle help                                         | ?
View the selected notification in the 'less' pager  | Etr
Toggle notification preview                         | Tab
Resize the preview window                           | S-Tab
Scroll the preview up/down                          | S-Up/Dn
Mark all displayed notifications as read and reload | C-a
Browser                                             | C-b
View diff                                           | C-d
View diff in patch format                           | C-p
Reload                                              | C-r
Mark the selected notification as read and reload   | C-t
Write a comment with the editor and quit            | C-x
Toggle the selected notification                    | C-y
Quit                                                | Esc